<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head>
<%- include('../partials/head',{bStaffPage:true}) %>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<script type="module" src="/js/customer.js"></script>
</head><body><%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content" class="container staff-page customer-page" tabindex="-1">
  <h1><%= ({account:'Your customer account',register:'Create your customer account','sign-in':'Customer sign-in',recover:'Recover your customer account'})[strMode] %></h1>
  <nav aria-label="Customer account navigation"><a href="/order">Order online</a> · <a href="/account">My account</a> · <a href="/account/sign-in">Sign in</a> · <a href="/account/register">Create account</a> · <a href="/staff/sign-in">Staff sign-in</a></nav>
  <% if(strError){ %><div class="notice" role="alert"><h2>Please check your request</h2><p><%= strError %></p></div><% } %>
  <% if(strNotice){ %><p class="notice" role="status"><%= strNotice %></p><% } %>
  <% if(arrRecoveryCodes.length){ %><section class="staff-card" id="customer-recovery-codes" aria-labelledby="codes-heading"><h2 id="codes-heading">Save your recovery codes</h2><p>Each code works once. Save them privately, separately from your password. These codes are shown only now. If you lose your password and every code, we cannot recover this account using your contact details. Recovery replaces all codes and signs out every session.</p><label for="private-codes">Private customer recovery codes</label><textarea id="private-codes" class="form-control" readonly rows="8" spellcheck="false"><%= arrRecoveryCodes.join('\n') %></textarea><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="hide-customer-codes">I saved my codes — hide them</button></section><% } %>
  <% if(strMode==='account'){ %>
    <p>Signed in as <strong><%= objAccount.strUsername %></strong>. This customer account does not grant staff access.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/account/sign-out"><input type="hidden" name="strCsrfToken" value="<%= strCsrfToken %>"><button class="btn btn-outline-primary">Sign out</button></form>
    <section class="staff-card mt-4"><h2>Saved contact details</h2><p>Optional: save details to fill in your next order. Review them at checkout. Saving here does not change earlier orders. Details stay until you delete your account or authorized project-data cleanup. Stopping the website alone does not erase retained disks. Use invented details for this demonstration.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/account/profile"><input type="hidden" name="strCsrfToken" value="<%= strCsrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="strRevision" value="<%= objAccount.intRevision %>">
    <% for(const [strKey,strLabel,strType,strAutocomplete,intMax] of [['strName','Your name','text','name',100],['strPhone','Phone number','tel','tel',40],['strEmail','Email address','email','email',254]]){ %>
    <div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="profile-<%= strKey %>"><%= strLabel %> (optional)</label><input class="form-control" id="profile-<%= strKey %>" name="<%= strKey %>" type="<%= strType %>" autocomplete="<%= strAutocomplete %>" maxlength="<%= intMax %>" value="<%= objAccount.objProfile[strKey] %>"></div><% } %>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Save contact details</button></form></section>
    <section class="staff-card mt-4"><h2>Your orders</h2><p>Only paid demonstration orders placed while signed in appear here. Guest orders are not linked by name or contact details. History disappears when order privacy information expires, normally seven days after the final outcome; unresolved cases may remain longer. Up to 100 recent eligible orders are shown. Refresh this page for current progress.</p>
    <% if(!arrOrders.length){ %><p>No eligible orders yet. <a href="/order">Start an order</a>, or use a guest order’s original private tracking link.</p><% } %>
    <% for(const objOrder of arrOrders){ %><article class="mb-4"><h3>Order <%= objOrder.strReference %></h3><p>Status: <strong><%= objOrder.strStatus %></strong><%= objOrder.bRefunded?' · Demonstration refund completed':'' %></p><ul><% for(const objItem of objOrder.arrItems){ %><li><%= objItem.intQuantity %> × <%= objItem.strName %></li><% } %></ul><p>Demonstration total: $<%= (objOrder.objTotals.centsTotal/100).toFixed(2) %>. No money was charged.</p></article><% } %>
    <p>For cancellation requests, use the private tracking link from your receipt. If you lost it, contact the restaurant; staff must verify the request.</p></section>
    <section class="staff-card mt-4"><h2>Delete your customer account</h2><p>This removes saved profile, password, recovery codes and account-to-order links, and signs you out everywhere. It does not cancel/refund orders or immediately delete their records. Orders keep the restaurant’s existing privacy schedule. This cannot be undone.</p><form method="post" action="/account/delete"><input type="hidden" name="strCsrfToken" value="<%= strCsrfToken %>"><label class="form-label" for="delete-password">Current password to confirm deletion</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="delete-password" name="strPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="1024"><button class="btn btn-outline-primary">Delete account permanently</button></form></section>
  <% }else{ %>
    <section class="staff-card mt-4"><p>Guest checkout remains available. Customer accounts and staff accounts are separate.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/account/<%= strMode %>"><input type="hidden" name="strCsrfToken" value="<%= strCsrfToken %>">
      <label class="form-label" for="customer-username">Username</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="customer-username" name="strUsername" autocomplete="username" minlength="3" maxlength="64" required aria-describedby="username-help"><p id="username-help">3–64 letters, numbers, dots, underscores or hyphens. Usernames ignore letter case.</p>
      <% if(strMode==='recover'){ %><label class="form-label" for="recovery-code">Unused customer recovery code</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="recovery-code" name="strRecoveryCode" type="password" autocomplete="off" maxlength="64" required><% } %>
      <label class="form-label" for="customer-password"><%= strMode==='recover'?'New password':'Password' %></label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="customer-password" name="<%= strMode==='recover'?'strNewPassword':'strPassword' %>" type="password" autocomplete="<%= strMode==='sign-in'?'current-password':'new-password' %>" maxlength="1024" <%- strMode==='sign-in'?'':'minlength="15"' %> required aria-describedby="password-help"><p id="password-help">Choose a unique passphrase of at least 15 characters. We never email your password.</p>
      <% if(strMode==='register'){ %><p>Registration provides private recovery codes. Save them: there is no email reset, and staff cannot use a name, phone or email to recover your account. Saved profiles remain until account deletion or authorized project-data cleanup; order history has its separate privacy deadline.</p><% } %>
      <button class="btn btn-primary"><%= ({register:'Create customer account','sign-in':'Sign in',recover:'Reset password and replace codes'})[strMode] %></button>
    </form></section><p class="mt-3"><a href="/account/recover">Forgot your password?</a> Use a saved customer recovery code. If you have no code and cannot sign in, create a new account; older orders remain accessible only through their original private links.</p>
  <% } %>
</main><%- include('../partials/footer') %></body></html>
